---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<Page
  title="Privacy information"
  eyebrow="YOUR PRIVACY MATTERS"
  description="How this website, WhatsApp contact and video players handle information."
>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      This static website has no patient accounts, appointment database, payment
      processing or on-site medical intake. No analytics or marketing scripts
      have been added.
    </p>
    <h2>Contacting Us About Your Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about how your personal information is handled, or to
      request access, correction or deletion of information you have shared with
      the clinic, please contact us through our official WhatsApp channel:
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>
        WhatsApp:{' '}
        <a href={site.whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          +91 93468 25723<span class="sr-only"> (opens a new tab)</span>
        </a>
      </strong>
    </p>
    <p>
      WhatsApp is a third-party messaging service. Messages are handled through
      that platform and may be subject to its privacy practices.
    </p>
    <p>
      Please avoid sharing sensitive medical records or detailed health
      information through an initial WhatsApp enquiry. WhatsApp is not intended
      for medical emergencies.
    </p>
    <p>
      Privacy-related requests will be reviewed by the clinic in accordance with
      its applicable obligations and confirmed data-handling procedures.
    </p>
    <h2>Videos</h2>
    <p>
      Video previews make no YouTube requests until you choose to load a player.
      The player uses YouTube’s privacy-enhanced domain, but playing a video
      connects to YouTube and is subject to its privacy practices. The Watch on
      YouTube links open YouTube in a new tab.
    </p>
    <h2>Hosting and access</h2>
    <p>
      Hosting and network providers may process technical request information to
      serve this website. The final hosting setup and clinic data-handling
      policy must be confirmed before launch.
    </p>
    <h2>Before production launch</h2>
    <p>
      The clinic’s retention period, access arrangements and final consent
      wording are awaiting approval. A final clinic-approved privacy policy will
      replace this information before production cutover.
    </p>
  </div>
</Page>
